---
---

<section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 bg-muted/50">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
        A common structure for complex engineering
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        SEC-Hub is made for teams that need a clear system structure, a shared
        engineering language and traceable information across disciplines.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      {/* Feature 1 */}
      <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M19 11a7 7 0 01-7 7m0 0a7 7 0 01-7-7m7 7v4m0 0H8m4 0h4"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Structure your systems</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Build and maintain hierarchical object structures with clear
          reference designations and project boundaries.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Feature 2 */}
      <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Understand relations</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Visualise interfaces and dependencies so teams can review complex
          relations across systems and disciplines.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Feature 3 */}
      <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-primary"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Collaborate in context</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Keep owners, progress, custom fields and engineering metadata close
          to the model instead of scattered across files.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
